The DUT has a bug: pulse<=din instead of din AND NOT previous. Fix it.

Let me write the corrected module.

module rising_edge(input clk, rst, din, output reg pulse);
reg previous;
always @(posedge clk) begin
  if (rst) begin
    previous <= 1'b0;
    pulse <= 1'b0;
  end else begin
    pulse <= din & ~previous;
    previous <= din;
  end
end
endmodule

That's it. Let me use edit_dut with expected revision id.

